waitmovement 0
return
= MtChimney_EventScript_Archie
lock
faceplayer
call_if_unset FLAG_EVIL_LEADER_PLEASE_STOP MtChimney_EventScript_ArchieGoStopTeamMagma
call_if_set FLAG_EVIL_LEADER_PLEASE_STOP MtChimney_EventScript_ArchieBusyFighting
closemessage
applymovement LOCALID_MT_CHIMNEY_ARCHIE Common_Movement_FaceOriginalDirection
waitmovement 0
setflag FLAG_EVIL_LEADER_PLEASE_STOP
release
end
= MtChimney_EventScript_ArchieBusyFighting
msgbox	ARCHIE: Grrr…I want to stop that MAXIE, but I can't!Not when I have my hands full battling three opponents at once!
return
= MtChimney_EventScript_ArchieGoStopTeamMagma
msgbox	ARCHIE: Grr, PLAYER! I should've guessed you'd show up!See for yourself what the fanatics of TEAM MAGMA are up to!They're trying to inject the stolen METEORITE's power into the volcano!Doing something like that will cause the volcano's eruption!
return
